  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Usually never cry at all",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I would say I'm pretty tough",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But it's been a couple weeks now and I still feel stuck in my lungs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And usually I go out on nights",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And not think of you once",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But if they start playin' that song",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I can't help but to think about us, oh, oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Really thought I'd be done with the hardest part",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "When I pulled myself out of your arms",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Wish I knew that was only the start",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And now I'm fallin' apart, 'cause",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Last night, for the very first time",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You didn't even try to call",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Oh, I, I won't lie, I thought I might die",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I couldn't even sleep at all",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And maybe I'll get used to it (Ah, ah, ah-ah, ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But right now I just feel like shit (Ah, ah, ah-ah, ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Oh, oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So I kissed somebody else",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Just to see how it felt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But all that was goin' through my brain",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Was your hands around my waist",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You know how to do it so well",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
