    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "bridge",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now, if I get a little too drunk, I'll start thinkin', \"What if you were the one?\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I know that the damage is done, done",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I still have the shirt that you wore when we first met",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It's there on the floor, I might kick it under the bed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Hopin' that I could forget that",
